      "value": "Spawn points should be portals themselves. So you appear near the door \"back\". But this could lead to a proliferation of portals when people come in from many places. Maybe the spawn could be a \"local\" door back to where you came, that disappears after a bit.\n-hackspanner",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
