      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I would love this idea because I've had lots of ideas for making things but then I remembered you can't do this. I would love if you could.  \n  \nI don't know much about the coding stuff but I imagine it could be as easy as letting us set a world id on a spawn point and anyone who spawns from that id will spawn there?",
      "viewerReactions": null
